( Based on the pilot done in Pune would like to share the following feedback and suggested way forward. ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* ( RA Housekeeping mobile app feedback) Tj
T* (1.        The color of RA should feature in the report in portal whenever any filters are applied.) Tj
T* (2.        In the mobile, an option is to be provided to view the non-synced outlets with details like &ndash;) Tj
T* (date, zone, outlet name, color of RA &amp; team.) Tj
T* (3.        There are three different reports for job overview in the portal all of which were showing same data,) Tj
T* (it is recommended to have only one type of such report in the portal.) Tj
T* (4.        Whenever the cleaning team is selecting one of the job cancellation reason \(bad weather/outlet) Tj
T* (closed or Owner rejected\). The option to take photo only for &ldquo;PRE SITE&rdquo;  &amp; &quot;POST) Tj
T* (SITE&quot; should be active, rest all scope of work including repairs should be inactive.) Tj
T* (5.        In the mobile app &ldquo;PRE SITE&rdquo; image to be active in the beginning and the) Tj
T* (&ldquo;POST SITE&rdquo; image is only to be active after taking retailer signature.) Tj
T* (6.        Currently the cleaner can access the cleaning work scopes available without selecting the outlet.) Tj
T* (We need to make selection of outlet as mandatory.) Tj
T* (7.        Create a new icon with label for creating &ldquo;New outlet &ldquo;in that zone.) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* (Regards, ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* () Tj
T* (----------------------------- ) Tj
T* (Chayan Majumdar ) Tj
T* (RSD ITD HO ) Tj
T* (M:9903955134) Tj
