(As per the discussion between Mayabious and ITC \( Sambhav, Chayan &amp; Bastab\) today. Following) Tj
T* (are the briefs. ) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* (Mobile App) Tj
T* (1\) While starting the app, it should prompt the user to turn on location service by going to settings without) Tj
T* (which the app will not let the user to proceed any further.) Tj
T* (2\) At least one worker should be added as a team member before a user can start a day. There will be) Tj
T* (provision for viewing / editing the workers so added in the team for a certain day in the app.) Tj
T* (3\) Save, Reset/Clear and Back buttons in the Owner Signature needs to be in the bottom of the screen in) Tj
T* (order to maintain similar design pattern all over the app.) Tj
T* (4\) Remark field for Repair section should open up a separate Modal with ample space to type out remarks /) Tj
T* (comments.) Tj
T* (5\) In the Repair section, provision for taking multiple images needs to be incorporated. The images thus) Tj
T* (taken should be displayed in a Grid or any convenient form.) Tj
T* (6\) A certain Team and the associated Workers will be identified with the mobile phone&rsquo;s IMEI) Tj
T* (Number.) Tj
T* (7\) A user can view his current location along with all the stores \(which he needs to clean that day\) location) Tj
T* (in the map.) Tj
T* (8\) A database synchronization methodology needs to be implemented where the app will be able to handle) Tj
T* (Online and Offline network state and upload data to the server showing an upload status bar. All data) Tj
T* (needs to be cleaned from app local storage after verifying successful sync operation.) Tj
T* (9\) A new feature has been proposed by the client. While installing the app, it needs to reserve some) Tj
T* (storage space \(size will be finalized later\) for its own use, so that it can store a fair amount of data locally in) Tj
T* (the mobile phone while servicing in remote areas with poor or no internet connectivity.) Tj
T* (10\) There needs to be some kind of notification / current status \(completed / failed etc\) of the sync) Tj
T* (operation in the app, so that the user gets to know whether all the data has been automatically synced with) Tj
T* (mother server or he/she needs to sync them manually.) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* (Admin Panel) Tj
T* (1\) We have total freedom for making up the entire database and associated back end service depending on) Tj
T* (client requirement.) Tj
T* (2\) There will a Dashboard showing different Charts and Reports, Consolidated summery backed by various) Tj
T* (filter attributes.) Tj
T* (3\) Mayabious personnel will be dedicated for admin operation based on their requirements. \( Add / Edit /) Tj
T* (Delete of various entities such as Location, Agency, Team, Worker etc based on their data access and role\)) Tj
T* (4\) Additional features will be suggested and embedded upon approval from client.) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* (What we have received) Tj
T* (1\) A few different reports in excel files.) Tj
T* (2\) A few Screen shots of their existing Admin Panel.) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* ( ) Tj
T* (A few things we will / may need as discussed) Tj
T* (1\) The Hierarchy of their operational personnel and any associated data client wish to share) Tj
T* (2\) A few more sessions to resolve further conflicts if any.) Tj
T* (Sent By  barun on Jan 25 2017  8:13PM ) Tj
ET
